WEBVTT

00:03:57.363 --> 00:04:00.130
But their real world
was nothing like our own.

00:04:02.463 --> 00:04:05.297
The real world of the Athenians
was alive with things

00:04:05.297 --> 00:04:09.763
that we would consider immaterial
and thus unreal.

00:04:09.797 --> 00:04:12.763
It pulsated with things like gods,

00:04:13.663 --> 00:04:17.063
spirits, nymphs, Fates,

00:04:17.097 --> 00:04:20.497
curses, oaths, souls

00:04:20.497 --> 00:04:23.930
and all kinds of mysterious energies
and magical forces.

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:27.930
Indeed the most important things
in their real world

00:04:27.963 --> 00:04:30.597
were not humans at all, but gods.